<title>CANADA: Algonquin in takeover bid for Durkin.</title>
<headline>Algonquin in takeover bid for Durkin.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algonquin Mercantile Corp said in a statement on Tuesday it intends to make a takeover bid to shareholders of Durkin Hayes Publishing Ltd to acquire up to eight million of the company's shares.</p>
<p>Algonquin said it is offering one common share of Algonquin for eight common shares of Durkin Hayes.</p>
<p>Algonquin said it currently owns 5.1 million common shares of Durkin and will own 13.1 million or 66 percent of the common shares of Durkin if the bid is successful.</p>
<p>The offer is subject to shareholder approval.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
</text>
